          "docs": "To propose and validate a spec for a new or existing app, send a POST request to the `/v2/apps/propose` endpoint. The request returns some information about the proposed app, including app cost and upgrade cost. If an existing app ID is specified, the app spec is treated as a proposed update to the existing app."
